        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Tobin Estate Agents are excited to bring to the market, this truly magnificent four-bedroom luxury residence, circa 320m² with double integrated garage.Wonder awaits as you round the corner of the sweeping gravel driveway, to this one-of-a-kind architecturally designed quality home. Set among stunning, secluded, low maintenance landscaped gardens, circa 1.4 acres offering privacy and security with a large south facing patio. Superbly located just off the N2, circa 6km north of Carrickmacross, circa 10 km south of Castleblayney, offering easy access to Dublin in around an hour.\r\n\r\nFeatures include: O.F.C.H zoned, u.P.V.C. double glazed windows and doors, solid wood interior woodwork & doors, cast iron radiators, new in-frame fitted kitchen, aga cooker, window blinds, quality sanitary ware, maintenance free exterior, wrought iron electric gates, kerbed and gravel driveway, large south facing patio, mature landscaped garden, home office / gym, floor area 320m², BER C2.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises: Porch: 2.1m x 1.1m; Entrance Hall: 4.5m x 2.9; Sitting room: 5.3m x 4.5m; Kitchen / dining room: 6.7m x 5m; Living room: 6m x 5m; Playroom: 5.9m x 4.2m; Guest w.c. 1.5m x 1.4m; Utility 3.4m x 3.1m; Bathroom 2.2m x 1.3m; Landing: 6.8m x 2.2m; Bathroom 2.9m x 2.4m; Master Suite: 5.8m x 5.2m; Ensuite: 2.9m x 2.9m, Bedroom 2: 4.5m x 4.5m; Bedroom 3: 4.5m x 3.4m;Bedroom 4: 4.2m x 3.4m; Office / Gym: 6.5m x 4m; Double lofted garage: 6.6m x 6.5m;"
      },
